Ôr@Ÿªassertions¤code´customTransformCache¬dependencies¢id¤meta±moduleSideEffects¬originalCode±originalSourcemap«resolvedIds®sourcemapChainµsyntheticNamedExportsµtransformDependencies®transformFiles¨cacheAstÔrAÚ‹Õ/**
 * Oscilloscope engine â€” reads from real simulation WaveData, renders waveform + FFT + math
 * v2: Probe-name mapping, live voltage sampling, proper multi-channel display
